---
// Vesmír — F9 TOP 5 infografika
// Komponenta zobrazuje strukturu vesmíru a Sluneční soustavy
---

<section class="ramecek infografika">
	<h2><span class="podtrh">Vesmír a Sluneční soustava 🌍🪐</span></h2>
	<p>
		<strong>Vesmír</strong> je obrovský systém obsahující miliardy hvězd a galaxií. Naše
		<strong>Sluneční soustava</strong> je součástí galaxie Mléčná dráha a skládá se ze
		Slunce a planet, které obíhají kolem něj díky gravitační síle.
	</p>

	<svg viewBox="0 0 600 550" role="img" aria-label="Vesmír a Sluneční soustava">
		<!-- Pozadí (hvězdné nebe) -->
		<rect x="0" y="0" width="600" height="550" fill="#0d1b2a" />
		<circle cx="50" cy="50" r="2" fill="#fff" opacity="0.8" />
		<circle cx="150" cy="80" r="1.5" fill="#fff" opacity="0.7" />
		<circle cx="200" cy="120" r="1" fill="#fff" opacity="0.6" />
		<circle cx="500" cy="100" r="2.5" fill="#fff" opacity="0.8" />
		<circle cx="550" cy="200" r="1.5" fill="#fff" opacity="0.7" />
		<circle cx="80" cy="300" r="1" fill="#fff" opacity="0.6" />
		<circle cx="520" cy="400" r="2" fill="#fff" opacity="0.8" />

		<!-- SLUNCE v centru -->
		<circle cx="300" cy="220" r="35" fill="#ffd43b" stroke="#f08c00" stroke-width="3" />
		<text x="300" y="228" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" font-weight="bold" fill="#2b2a26">SLUNCE</text>

		<!-- Oběžné dráhy -->
		<circle cx="300" cy="220" r="60" fill="none" stroke="#888" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="3,2" opacity="0.5" />
		<circle cx="300" cy="220" r="100" fill="none" stroke="#888" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="3,2" opacity="0.5" />
		<circle cx="300" cy="220" r="140" fill="none" stroke="#888" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="3,2" opacity="0.5" />

		<!-- Merkur (nejblíž Slunci) -->
		<circle cx="360" cy="220" r="8" fill="#a39999" stroke="#2b2a26" stroke-width="1" />
		<text x="360" y="245" text-anchor="middle" font-size="9" fill="#e0e0e0">Merkur</text>

		<!-- Venuše -->
		<circle cx="280" cy="280" r="14" fill="#ffc857" stroke="#2b2a26" stroke-width="1" />
		<text x="280" y="310" text-anchor="middle" font-size="9" fill="#e0e0e0">Venuše</text>

		<!-- Země -->
		<circle cx="320" cy="320" r="15" fill="#4a90e2" stroke="#2b2a26" stroke-width="1" />
		<circle cx="325" cy="320" r="4" fill="#2d6e1e" opacity="0.6" />
		<text x="320" y="350" text-anchor="middle" font-size="9" fill="#e0e0e0">Země</text>

		<!-- Mars -->
		<circle cx="230" cy="290" r="10" fill="#e03131" stroke="#2b2a26" stroke-width="1" />
		<text x="230" y="320" text-anchor="middle" font-size="9" fill="#e0e0e0">Mars</text>

		<!-- Jupiter (velká planeta) -->
		<circle cx="440" cy="220" r="30" fill="#c9876e" stroke="#2b2a26" stroke-width="2" />
		<ellipse cx="440" cy="220" rx="28" ry="3" fill="none" stroke="#a37052" stroke-width="1" opacity="0.6" />
		<ellipse cx="440" cy="210" rx="28" ry="3" fill="none" stroke="#a37052" stroke-width="1" opacity="0.6" />
		<text x="440" y="365" text-anchor="middle" font-size="9" fill="#e0e0e0">Jupiter</text>

		<!-- Saturn (s prstenci) -->
		<circle cx="300" cy="100" r="22" fill="#d4a574" stroke="#2b2a26" stroke-width="2" />
		<ellipse cx="300" cy="100" rx="45" ry="8" fill="none" stroke="#b8956a" stroke-width="2" opacity="0.8" />
		<text x="300" y="65" text-anchor="middle" font-size="9" fill="#e0e0e0">Saturn</text>

		<!-- Uran -->
		<circle cx="160" cy="200" r="14" fill="#4fd0e7" stroke="#2b2a26" stroke-width="1" opacity="0.8" />
		<text x="160" y="235" text-anchor="middle" font-size="9" fill="#e0e0e0">Uran</text>

		<!-- Neptun -->
		<circle cx="100" cy="100" r="14" fill="#4166f5" stroke="#2b2a26" stroke-width="1" opacity="0.8" />
		<text x="100" y="65" text-anchor="middle" font-size="9" fill="#e0e0e0">Neptun</text>

		<!-- Informační box -->
		<rect x="20" y="420" width="560" height="120" rx="8" fill="#1971c2" stroke="#e0e0e0" stroke-width="2" />
		<text x="300" y="445" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" font-weight="bold" fill="#e0e0e0">
			Sluneční soustava se skládá z 8 planet
		</text>
		<text x="300" y="468" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" fill="#e0e0e0">
			Vnitřní (horké, blíz Slunci): Merkur, Venuše, Země, Mars
		</text>
		<text x="300" y="488" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" fill="#e0e0e0">
			Vnější (studené, daleko): Jupiter, Saturn, Uran, Neptun
		</text>
		<text x="300" y="510" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" fill="#e0e0e0">
			Všechny planety obíhají Slunce díky gravitační síle
		</text>
		<text x="300" y="530" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" fill="#ffd43b" font-weight="bold">
			Náš domov — planeta Země — je od Slunce vzdálená 150 milionů kilometrů
		</text>
	</svg>
</section>

<style>
	.infografika { padding: 1.5rem; }
	.infografika h2 { margin-top: 0; }
	.infografika svg { width: 100%; max-width: 600px; border: 3px solid #2b2a26; border-radius: 12px; background: #0d1b2a; margin: 1rem 0; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; }
	.podtrh { border-bottom: 3px solid #ffd43b; padding-bottom: 2px; }
</style>
